mra_encode() and mra_compare() follow match_rating_codex() and
match_rating_comparison() of the Python package jellyfish
(https://github.com/jamesturk/jellyfish), and the banding chosen by
minhash_pairs() follows _optimal_param() of the Python package datasketch
(https://github.com/ekzhu/datasketch). Both are distributed under the MIT
licence (as quoted above for RapidFuzz), with these copyright notices:

